                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【SD Live Performances】Madonna - Re-Invention World Tour 2004 (Live in Lisbon)]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/madonna-re-invention-world-tour-2004-live-in-lisbon.307149/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					On September 14, 2004, the final show of Madonna's <b>Re-Invention World Tour</b> took place in Lisbon, Portugal. <br>
<br>
The Lisbon concert was recorded and considered for a DVD release, but these plans were unfortunately shelved, and Madonna released her <a href="https://sharemania.us/threads/madonna-im-going-to-tell-you-a-secret-dvd-iso-pal.304789/" class="internalLink">I'm Going to Tell You a Secret</a> documentary instead. However, a rough cut leaked on the internet several years later. To date this remains the only complete, professionally shot recording of the <i>Re-Invention World Tour</i> available to us.<br>
<br>
If the tour had gotten a proper DVD release, this would've been the perfect DVD cover (apart from the two typos in the tracklist lol):<br>
<br>
